      {
        "id": 234109,
        "name": "dpt",
        "username": "dpt",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dpt/{size}/1922_2.png",
        "created_at": "2020-10-31T20:32:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>On Blitz with innates, you do indeed need to meet one threshold. There was a <a href=\"https://querki.net/u/darker/spirit-island-faq/#!.7w4gebp\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">relevant FAQ</a>, but it was missing a tag for the Blitz scenario.</p>\n<p>And absolutely you can target a land with Elemental Invocation to meet your thresholds.</p>\n<p>But note that the first paragraph of Volcano's innate is in fact a threshold, just one that requires 0 elements, and would trigger things like the Blitz rebate: here's <a href=\"https://querki.net/u/darker/spirit-island-faq/#!.7w4geaf\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">the FAQ on Volcano</a>. The FAQ doesn't address whether destroying 0 Presence (doing nothing) would be enough to get the rebate; I'll check on that.</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:10:06.848Z",
